  "summary": "In crowdfunding, we know that the bigger the launch, the bigger the campaign. So what if you had a new way to maximize your pre-launch audience and excitement while activating and rewarding your most eager fans? Introducing the BackerKit Pre-Launch Reservation The new BackerKit Pre-Launch Reservation allows creators to offer backers the ability to reserve […] The post Introducing BackerKit Pre-Launch Reservation appeared first on Crowdfunding Blog & Resources | BackerKit .",
